---
// src/components/sections/ConsoleOutputSection.astro
---

<section class="section-surface console-output">
    <div class="console-output__header">
      <p>Salida / V1</p>
      <p>ESP32 → Computadora</p>
    </div>
  
    <div class="console-output__content">
      <div class="console-output__intro">
        <h2>La primera victoria es ver el dato.</h2>
  
        <p>
          Antes de Wi-Fi o interfaz web, la V1 termina cuando el ESP32 entrega
          lecturas estables de humedad y podemos observarlas directamente en la
          computadora.
        </p>
      </div>
  
      <div class="console-output__terminal" aria-label="Ejemplo de salida por consola">
        <div class="console-output__terminal-header">
          <span>Serial Monitor</span>
          <span>Demo</span>
        </div>
  
        <div class="console-output__lines">
          <p><span>01</span> Lectura sensor: ----</p>
          <p><span>02</span> Humedad: --%</p>
          <p><span>03</span> Estado: sin calibrar</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .console-output {
      background: var(--color-olive-bg);
      color: var(--color-olive);
    }
  
    .console-output__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  
    .console-output__header p {
      margin: 0;
  
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .console-output__content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(22rem, 1fr);
      align-items: end;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  
    .console-output__intro h2 {
      max-width: 9ch;
      margin: 0;
  
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 0.88;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }
  
    .console-output__intro > p {
      max-width: 30rem;
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
  
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  
    .console-output__terminal {
      border: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }
  
    .console-output__terminal-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
  
      padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
  
      border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
  
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
  
    .console-output__lines {
      padding: 1rem;
    }
  
    .console-output__lines p {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
  
      margin: 0;
  
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  
    .console-output__lines p + p {
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
  
    .console-output__lines span {
      opacity: 0.65;
    }
  
    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
      .console-output__header {
        gap: 1rem;
      }
  
      .console-output__content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        align-content: end;
        gap: 3rem;
      }
  
      .console-output__intro {
        padding-top: 2rem;
      }
  
      .console-output__intro h2 {
        max-width: 8ch;
        font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 17vw, 6rem);
      }
    }
  </style>